    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43cf826f8bb73659",
      "translationZh": "分享一款名为 AskCyph Health Explorer 的教育工具，用于探索 DNA 单字母突变如何导致疾病、如何改变三维解剖结构、遗传概率以及可用的治疗方法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2138e1136a6faa9",
      "translationZh": "为了在保护用户隐私的同时实现交互功能，该架构将工作负载分配给两个模型：AlphaGenome 负责分子生物学预测，而 MedGemma 1.5 4B 则通过 WebGPU 在你的浏览器中 100% 本地运行，充当保护隐私的讲解助手。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "63dc83919076741c",
      "translationZh": "流水线如何运作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "23f69006e586d0bb",
      "translationZh": "预测分子层面的影响（AlphaGenome）：该应用并非让 LLM 凭空编造密码子的作用机制，而是连接 Google DeepMind 的 AlphaGenome API，预测调控性变异的影响和剪接异常（例如，对比镰状细胞病中直接改变编码的变异与破坏 RNA 剪接的非编码区 β-地中海贫血突变）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "56fd060aa179e462",
      "translationZh": "保护隐私的客户端讲解助手（通过 WebGPU 运行 MedGemma 1.5 4B）：所有用户交互、聊天追问和多模态检查都使用 ONNX Runtime Web，完全在你的本地硬件上运行。当你询问遗传风险，或拖入 X 光片/组织学图像时，不会向任何外部服务器发送提示词、图像或聊天词元。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "736cc4d668cf9f07",
      "translationZh": "确定性事实依据：变异详情、OMIM ID、遗传方式和药物批准信息直接从 NCBI ClinVar、openFDA 和 ClinicalTrials.gov 获取，并注入 MedGemma 的提示词。本地模型用通俗语言综合已核实的事实和 AlphaGenome 评分，不会编造临床细节。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "308ebef00143dc72",
      "translationZh": "技术规格与性能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5a09479fba5c47b2",
      "translationZh": "模型：MedGemma 1.5 4B（INT4 ONNX，支持回退至 FP16/FP32 执行）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0c68bc53e52cddf4",
      "translationZh": "运行时：通过 ONNX Runtime Web 使用 WebGPU。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "36bdddb2c3625b60",
      "translationZh": "多模态：视觉投影层在设备端执行，以检查上传的临床图示。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6c066bf2acbd6247",
      "translationZh": "存储：约 2.8 GB 的压缩权重，本地缓存以便后续即时加载。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7d90fc59956c51b5",
      "translationZh": "零门槛：无需登录，而且免费。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
